 "submission": {
  "summary": "Two early wells, F-12 and F-14, produced most of Volve's oil — 84.9% of the 10.04 million Sm3 produced to 2016-12-01, with F-12 the largest at 4.58 million Sm3 (45.6%) and F-14 at 3.94 million Sm3 (39.3%), followed by later well F-11 at 1.15 million Sm3 (11.4%).",
